<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 492.22 mln rand S.African bonds Wed.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 492.22 mln rand S.African bonds Wed.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought 492.22 million rands worth of South African bonds on Wednesday after buying 149.14 million rands worth on Tuesday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
